          "quotes": ["Take the trick with the ace, keeping the king as a later heart control."]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "decision-0003",
      "status": "pass",
      "findings": [
        {
          "dimension": "feasibility",
          "fact": "C3 can be led toward dummy’s CA without spending South’s CK or CQ.",
          "explanation": "South is on lead holding C3, CK and CQ; dummy holds CA. This is a legal, concrete route to dummy.",
          "quotes": ["Start developing the club winners by leading low toward dummy’s ace, preserving South’s honors for later cashing."]
        }
      ]
    },
